WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes sounds manageable.
But a short session is not proof of an hour's benefits.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Zen12's seller describes twelve levels,
four listening styles per level, and audio downloads.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A convenient format is understandable.
The biggest promised benefits still need specific proof.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
One independent brainwave review found mixed
EEG results across fourteen studies—not a Zen12 trial.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Start with a free timer.
Write down what happened and whether it was useful.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then read the evidence guide.
Decide if you want the package for its format.
